Upstream licence for the code ported into `src/puff/`
=====================================================

The `changi::puff` module is a Rust translation of the R package `puff`,
"Simulate and Visualize the Gaussian Puff Forward Atmospheric Model", by the
Hammerling Research Group at the Colorado School of Mines.

    Upstream project : https://github.com/Hammerling-Research-Group/puff
    Upstream version : 0.1.1 (CRAN), commit 5213d58
    Upstream licence : MIT + file LICENSE

Upstream's `DESCRIPTION` declares `License: MIT + file LICENSE`, which is CRAN's
convention: the repository ships a two-line `LICENSE` file carrying only the
year and copyright holder, and CRAN supplies the MIT text. That stub reads, in
full and verbatim:

    YEAR: 2025
    COPYRIGHT HOLDER: Hammerling Research Group

The MIT text it refers to is reproduced below with those values substituted.

